  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja2_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - <color=#FF00FF>Campfires</color> like this are perfect for <color=#FF00FF>resting</color>
    after an arduous path. I suggest you stop by when you come across them.
  - <shake>OH! (cof, cof)</shake> I almost forgot.
  - Along with the <color=#00FFFF>curse</color>, some great powers appeared, stalking
    what once was my beloved town and its outskirts.
  - It is possible to extract part of their <color=#FF00FF>skills</color>. You will
    need them to satisfy my errand... <jump>starting with this one.</jump>
